              <p>ISO/IEC 27090:2026, <em>Cybersecurity, Artificial intelligence (AI), Addressing security threats and compromises to AI systems</em>, was published in October 2026. It is guidance, not a certifiable standard, and is written to complement ISO/IEC 27001 and ISO/IEC 27002.</p>
