          </figure>

          <p class="rv">The result is one management system with one risk register, in which AI threats, AI impacts and information security risks are visible side by side.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- 03 ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <section id="one-system" class="sec">
          <div class="sec-head rv">
            <span class="sec-n">03</span>
            <h2>One system, fewer gaps</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="rv">Bernard’s point and Wikus’s point arrive at the same place. <span class="hl">The standards were designed to fit together, and the newest guidance assumes they will.</span></p>
